From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shayne Legault <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:28:46 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: apple: drop the dormant P105 framebuffer tracer

The helper never enables drawing. Remove the scanout tracer, the unused
alternate stack experiment and the trace calls in core boot and fork code.
Preserve the framebuffer reservation and the AIC register readback because
the event read can consume a pending interrupt.

Link: https://github.com/OrchardLinux/orchard/issues/79
Assisted-by: LLM
